{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14043","headline":"晚夏即事临南居 · 耿湋","name":"晚夏即事临南居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何须学从宦，其奈本无机。\n蕙草芳菲歇，青山早晚归。\n广庭余落照，高枕对闲扉。\n树色迎秋老，蝉声过雨稀。\n艰难逢事异，去就与时违。\n遥忆衡门外，苍苍三径微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14043.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14043","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}